# F3 envelope and posture (design §9.2): T-single (one ordinal; fleet mode
# needs FLEET_MAX > 1, so FLEET_MAX=2 with no second ordinal: capped, it
# cannot scale out, and its heartbeats carry cpu_pct) + one generator,
# KEEP_AWAKE=1, scraped. Generator plan: plans/f3-b64rand.plan.
SERVERS=1
ROUTERS=0
KEEP_AWAKE=1
KEEP_AWAKE_TTL_MIN=150         # ~1.5 h run plus margin; enforced in-instance
SCRAPE=1
WAL_POSTURE=P-500
INITIAL_SHARDS=4
